description:
Update lib/editor/types.ts with new types for multi-select and grouping:

- Add SelectedElementGroup interface containing array of SelectedElement
- Add GroupedAIEditRequest interface for batch operations
- Add new IframeMessage types: 'element-multi-selected', 'group-created', 'group-updated'
- Add GroupQuickAction type for actions that make sense on groups
- Consider adding group metadata (name, created timestamp, etc.)

Types needed:
```typescript
interface SelectedElementGroup {
  id: string;
  elements: SelectedElement[];
  name?: string;
}

interface GroupedAIEditRequest {
  portfolioId: string;
  group: SelectedElementGroup;
  instruction: string;
  quickAction?: GroupQuickAction;
  fullHtml: string;
}
```
